# Laravel Auth Flow

- Treat `admin`, `business`, and `client` as the only valid roles.
- Keep Google OAuth as the primary sign-in path and preserve email/password only as a fallback.
- New social sign-ins default to `client` unless an explicit business-access flow promotes them.
- Do not let public signup self-assign a business account without an approval step.
- Gate incomplete users with onboarding middleware before dashboard or booking flows.
- Gate unapproved business users before any business management routes.
- Prefer focused feature tests for redirects, middleware, and role transitions whenever auth changes.
